zj/thumb/9/98/n7ud88aanixlyfzl7rk1i7iq4anlkpg.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%BC%A6%E5%85%89%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%BF.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/98/n7ud88aanixlyfzl7rk1i7iq4anlkpg.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%BC%A6%E5%85%89%E4%B8%80%E7%BA%BF.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/98/n7ud88aanixlyfzl7rk1i7iq4anlkpg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />弦光一线\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>普攻\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（普攻）单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">70%</font>物理伤害，若与敌人距离小于等于<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格，则额外击退<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格。攻击后，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦攻击时若与目标处于直线上，则额外对正前方<font color=\"#ed7950\">1*3</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>范围物理伤害。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/m4gv8o4dpxzc7r9lpuzb4xhyp1ivq98.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https